<title>SPAIN: Banesto sells its 10 pct stake in Telecinco.</title>
<headline>Banesto sells its 10 pct stake in Telecinco.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banesto, a unit of Spanish bank Grupo Santander, said on Wednesday that it had sold its 10 percent stake in Gestevision Telecinco S.A. for three billion pesetas.</p>
<p>In a statement, Banesto said it had awarded the stake in repayment for a loan extended by Servifilm Spain Cenematografica S.A. of Grupo Hachuel.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
